      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Compare two PDF versions\n\n**Before running:** set your credential on every Cloud Office Print, Google Drive and Google Sheets node, one by one. n8n does not copy credentials across imported nodes. Then pick your own files in the empty File and Document fields.\n\nDownloads two versions of a contract from Drive, compares them, and uploads a PDF marking the differences.\n\n### Setup\nUpload `docs/assets/samples/contract-v1.pdf` and `contract-v2.pdf` to your Drive, then select them in the two download nodes.",
